    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Version>1.0.0</Version>
    <Description>Apache Kafka IEventBus implementation (consumer group + commit-after-success) for the MassLab framework.</Description>
